TEXT(R"S47HR("A match in sound is not a shared source record. Keep tonight's monitor and the labelled reel separate.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_by02_live_check_presented":true},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"BY02_SOURCE_COMPARE","phase":"archive","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"To lagrede fullf\u00f8rte kildepr\u00f8ver og nytt sp\u00f8rsm\u00e5l er sammenlignet. Aktuell TAPE-/LIVE-velger er gjensidig utelukkende; resultatet krever ikke at begge er valgt samtidig.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_by02_reel_identity","ctx_hr_by02_question_compared","ctx_hr_by02_tape_sample_verified","ctx_hr_by02_live_sample_verified"],"none":["hr_by02_source_compare_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"BY02_SOURCE_COMPARE_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The isolated reel repeats the same old fragment after a new question. The recorded words have not answered it.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."},{"id":"BY02_SOURCE_COMPARE_002","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The dated local reel is a separately preserved source. Record the source and timing. Direction still needs fixed landmarks and field observations.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_by02_source_compare_presented":true},"give_documents":["HR_EARL_SOURCE_CHECK"]}},{"id":"BY02_LATE_COPY","phase":"archive","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Sen legitim datert kildekopi er identifisert mot konvolutt/logg/frakoblingsark, faktisk avspilt isolert p\u00e5 lobbydekket og nytt sp\u00f8rsm\u00e5l sammenlignet med uendret fragment. Ingen Earl-replikk etter04:00. Bare metadata gir ingen lydkonklusjon.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_by02_dated_lead","ctx_hr_by02_source_copy_verified","ctx_hr_by02_question_compared"],"none":["hr_by02_late_copy_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"BY02_LATE_COPY_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"Earl has left. In the lobby, a labelled envelope holds his dated source copy, the off-air log copy and the marked playback-disconnection sheet.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."},{"id":"BY02_LATE_COPY_002","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"You checked the copy on the isolated lobby deck. Its old fragment stays unchanged after your question. There is no new live reply from Earl.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."},{"id":"BY02_LATE_COPY_003","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"This is a checked copy of the identified source, not a claim to have handled the original reel. Keep that limit on the record.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_by02_late_copy_presented":true},"give_documents":["HR_EARL_SOURCE_COPY"]}},{"id":"BY02_INCOMPLETE","phase":"archive","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Ingen konklusjon eller kildekvittering ved uavklart opphav.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_by02_source_insufficient"],"none":[]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"BY02_INCOMPLETE_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The source or signal path is not verified. Ask for the labelled off-air log and use the isolated playback position. A familiar sound alone is not the check.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"ARRAY_BRIEF","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Eget ordin\u00e6rt servicevedlegg fra EveningShift, ikke omskriving av kulvertindeks eller tre-bokser-g\u00e5te.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_array_service_card_acquired"],"none":["hr_array_brief_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"ARRAY_BRIEF_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The separate array service card marks A / ROW 1 WEST, B / ROW 1 EAST and REF / R1. It describes an ordinary comparison, not what the array will follow.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."},{"id":"ARRAY_BRIEF_002","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"Identify the nearby dishes and check their command history. Leave the reference lamp fixed. Choose either operator place first, then the other, then return briefly.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_array_brief_presented":true},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"ARRAY_COMMAND_CHECK","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Separat faktisk kommando-/drivkontroll; \u00e5pnet papir er utilstrekkelig.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_array_command_checked"],"none":["hr_array_command_check_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.)S47HR")
TEXT(R"S47HR(","lines":[{"id":"ARRAY_COMMAND_CHECK_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The nearby dish identifiers match the local command and drive record you checked. The automatic schedule remains isolated; this is a separate bounded service check.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_array_command_check_presented":true},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"ARRAY_FIXED_REFERENCE","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Faktisk lampeplassering/innstilling i verdensrommet; ingen logger som m\u00e5ler peiling.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_array_reference_fixed"],"none":["hr_array_fixed_reference_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"ARRAY_FIXED_REFERENCE_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The reference lamp stays at REF / R1 at the same setting. Move yourself, not the lamp. Compare the dishes against the fixed Row One landmarks.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_array_fixed_reference_presented":true},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"ARRAY_POINT_A","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Faktisk A-posisjon/sikt/respons. Kan v\u00e6re f\u00f8rste eller andre st\u00e5sted; ingen klokkeanimert fasit.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_array_command_checked","ctx_hr_array_reference_fixed","ctx_hr_array_a_observed"],"none":["hr_array_point_a_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"ARRAY_POINT_A_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"At A / ROW 1 WEST, the observed dishes turn towards this operator position. REF / R1 and the fixed landmarks have not moved. Record what you actually see from here.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_array_point_a_presented":true},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"ARRAY_POINT_B","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Faktisk B-posisjon/sikt/respons, fritt A\u2192B/B\u2192A.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_array_command_checked","ctx_hr_array_reference_fixed","ctx_hr_array_b_observed"],"none":["hr_array_point_b_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"ARRAY_POINT_B_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"At B / ROW 1 EAST, the observed dishes turn towards this operator position. The reference lamp is still at REF / R1. Compare their angles against the same landmarks.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_array_point_b_presented":true},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"ARRAY_RETURN","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Faktisk retur til det f\u00f8rst valgte st\u00e5stedet; kontrollert forskjellig respons ved samme klokke.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_array_a_observed","ctx_hr_array_b_observed","ctx_hr_array_return_observed"],"none":["hr_array_return_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"ARRAY_RETURN_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"On your short return to the first operator place, the dishes turn back towards it. The response follows your chosen route, not a fixed order of stations.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_array_return_presented":true},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"ARRAY_RESULT","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Styring/geometri adskilt fra lyd. Ingen l\u00f8sning p\u00e5 C/Nora eller pliktfoto under senere fare.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_array_command_checked","ctx_hr_array_reference_fixed","ctx_hr_array_a_observed","ctx_hr_array_b_observed","ctx_hr_array_return_observed","ctx_hr_array_geometry_compared","ctx_hr_array_command_history_compared"],"none":["hr_array_result_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"ARRAY_RESULT_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The physical response followed the operator between two places and back while the reference lamp stayed fixed. The separate command record does not account for those changes.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."},{"id":"ARRAY_RESULT_002","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"That is a result for this controlled path. It does not establish anyone's identity, a county-wide safe route or what happened to Tom\u00e1s. STATION 01 records an older arrangement to examine next.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_array_result_presented":true},"give_documents":["HR_ARRAY_CONTROL_NOTE"]}},{"id":"ARRAY_RETREAT","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Arrayets trusselm\u00f8te fysisk vellykket retrett. Ingen gammel Warning/Force eller ny stor STATION01-jakt.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_array_geometry_compared","ctx_hr_)S47HR")
TEXT(R"S47HR(array_escape_complete"],"none":["hr_array_retreat_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"ARRAY_RETREAT_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"You used the clear passage and broke contact behind opaque cover. The searching figure has withdrawn. The completed comparison is preserved.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_array_retreat_presented":true},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"ARRAY_EMPTY_HOLD","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Bare faktisk observert tomt st\u00e5sted/retur026 etter riktig retrett; ikke gratis fra avslutning.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_array_escape_complete","ctx_hr_array_empty_hold_observed"],"none":["hr_array_empty_hold_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"ARRAY_EMPTY_HOLD_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The dishes hold briefly on the empty place you left. Then they return to 026. Nobody is standing there now.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_array_empty_hold_presented":true},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"ARRAY_RETRY","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Lokal retrettretry, ingen gammel teller/tidstap/gjenganger.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_array_local_retry"],"none":[]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"ARRAY_RETRY_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The command, source and geometry checks are preserved. Resume from the covered point before the passage was searched; choose a clear retreat.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"ARRAY_INCOMPLETE","phase":"field","channel":"ui","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Bevar faktiske delm\u00e5linger uten \u00e5 fabrikkere samlet kontroll.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_array_insufficient"],"none":[]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"ARRAY_INCOMPLETE_001","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The comparison is incomplete. Keep the fixed lamp in place, check the other marked position and return to the first. Do not record a tracking result without the geometry and command checks.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"SC12_PATROL_SHEET","phase":"all_night","channel":"physical","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Etter 04:30 er sheriffbetjenten faktisk i dineren og har lagt sitt daterte patruljeark p\u00e5 disken; spilleren har lest det. \u00c9n kj\u00f8retur er begrenset veiopplysning, ingen trygghetsgaranti. Erstatter sj\u00e5f\u00f8rrollen.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_sc12_patrol_sheet_read"],"none":["hr_sc12_patrol_sheet_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"SC12_PATROL_SHEET_001","speaker":"DEPUTY","text":"Drove the loop at half past three. Nothing on the road. It's on the sheet.","delivery_nb":"Eksisterende sheriffbetjent ved Caliche-avdelingen (THE DEPUTY i FS47Caliche), revisjonens \u00absheriffen\u00bb. Kort og praktisk; kjenner bare egne patruljer, patruljearket og savnetsaken. Tekst uten ny stemme, som hans eksisterende samtaler."},{"id":"SC12_PATROL_SHEET_002","speaker":"DESCRIPTION","text":"The patrol sheet is dated and timed in his hand: 03:30, north road and old Roswell road, no obstruction. One drive, an hour ago. It promises nothing about the road now.","delivery_nb":"Engelsk unders\u00f8kelsestekst. Ingen diegetisk forteller eller Kinski-opplesning i denne pakken."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_sc12_patrol_sheet_presented":true},"give_documents":[]}},{"id":"SC12_ROUTE_READBACK","phase":"all_night","channel":"phone","mode":"live","entry":"trigger","trigger_nb":"Sheriffbetjentens daterte patruljeark og reell budkvittering trengs. Ingen 1985-kvittering eller gammel sj\u00e5f\u00f8rtur som fersk veiopplysning.","requires":{"all":["ctx_hr_warning_acknowledged","ctx_hr_h09_checked","ctx_hr_sc12_patrol_sheet_read","ctx_hr_sc12_courier_104_confirmed"],"none":["hr_sc12_route_readback_presented"]},"direction_nb":"Kort, konkret og begrenset til faktisk kunnskap. Verden/hendelsesadapteren eier kravflagget. Ved pause, panel eller avbrudd gis ingen uopplevd konklusjon.","lines":[{"id":"SC12_ROUTE_READBACK_001","speaker":"WARD","text":"The deputy's sheet puts one clear drive on that road at half past three. I have its time in the log. It is one report, not a map of everywhere it is safe.","delivery_nb":"Eksisterende vakthavende. M\u00e5 ikke sl\u00e5s sammen med Dale."},{"id":"SC12_ROUTE_READBACK_002","speaker":"WARD","text":"The courier is confirmed at bolt ten-point-four, beyond the mapped C crossing at eight-point-one-five. Carry the originals. No stopping or new reading at C.","delivery_nb":"Eksisterende vakthavende. M\u00e5 ikke sl\u00e5s sammen med Dale."},{"id":"SC12_ROUTE_READBACK_003","speaker":"WARD","text":"The warning and the three source IDs are already outside SARO. Yo)S47HR")
TEXT(R"S47HR(u can stay at the diner; the handover keeps the originals together. It is not a new experiment.","delivery_nb":"Eksisterende vakthavende. M\u00e5 ikke sl\u00e5s sammen med Dale."}],"choices":[],"on_complete":{"set_flags":{"hr_sc12_route_readback_presented":true},"give_documents":["HR_ROUTE_READBACK"]}}],"documents":[{"id":"HR_INITIAL_REPORT","title":"Initial window report","kind":"typed","stamp":"SARO / NIGHT SHIFT / 13-14 APR 1986","body":["CALICHE DISPATCH / INITIAL REPORT. SARO control-room window, outside face of glass. Reyes reports a moving hand or forearm. Identity not established. Exterior marks are a separate physical check and are not certified by this first call.","The incident time and caller's location are copied from the actual call log and read back. This report does not establish a relief dispatch or a missing person."],"production_nb":"Adapter m\u00e5 sette faktisk in-game dato/tid/sted fra f\u00f8rste meldingslogg. Ingen oppdiktet permanent klokkeslett."},{"id":"HR_TRAFO_ENCOUNTER","title":"Caliche Junction encounter note","kind":"typed","stamp":"SARO / NIGHT SHIFT / 13-14 APR 1986","body":["The completed local lamp check remains recorded on its service card. Physical return filing at SARO is a separate action. At the service front a pale body moved under direct observation and turned towards new sound.","Reyes used the available route outside the fence, reached SARO 07 and broke contact. This note does not identify the body or explain the lamp fault."],"production_nb":"Bare faktisk vellykket flukt. Lokal retry gir ikke denne f\u00f8r ny vellykket retrett."},{"id":"HR_DISPATCH_RECEIPT","title":"District relief dispatch receipt","kind":"typed","stamp":"SARO / NIGHT SHIFT / 13-14 APR 1986","body":["CALICHE DISPATCH / RELIEF REQUEST. Reports at SARO and Caliche Junction linked under the current incident reference.","Regional technician Mara Ortiz, district wagon 23, assigned to meet Reyes at the public Caliche fuel stop. Actual dispatch time and contact readback attached.","This is an assignment record. It is not proof of arrival, abduction or a missing-person filing."],"production_nb":"Reell utkalling har egen dato/tid/ID fra adapter. Ny person/vogn m\u00e5 produseres."},{"id":"HR_HELPER_TRACE_NOTE","title":"Wagon 23: observed traces","kind":"typed","stamp":"SARO / NIGHT SHIFT / 13-14 APR 1986","body":["After reaching cover, Reyes checked the empty district wagon, the thermos on the asphalt and the marks in the gravel beside it. Tape on the thermos names Mara Ortiz.","The trace note records what remained. The separately witnessed lift and the subsequent missing-person report have their own records."],"production_nb":"Faktiske navngitte rekvisitter (vogn, termos, merker i grusen) m\u00e5 finnes; ikke l\u00f8ft-credit fra bare objekter."},{"id":"HR_MISSING_RECEIPT","title":"Mara Ortiz: missing-person receipt","kind":"typed","stamp":"SARO / NIGHT SHIFT / 13-14 APR 1986","body":["CALICHE DISPATCH / MISSING PERSON. Mara Ortiz, district maintenance, last seen at the public Caliche fuel stop beside wagon 23.","Reyes reports seeing Ortiz rise clear of support in an external light and then disappear. Dispatch has read back identity, place and actual report time, and linked the relief assignment.","Search assigned to the sheriff's office; the deputy is sent to the fuel stop. This report does not explain the disappearance."],"production_nb":"Dynamisk hendelses-ID/dato/tid fra faktisk savnetmelding, adskilt fra utkallingskvittering."},{"id":"HR_LOCAL_HOLD_RECEIPT","title":"SARO local morning-series hold","kind":"typed","stamp":"SARO / NIGHT SHIFT / 13-14 APR 1986","body":["DR. WARD / LOCAL WORK ORDER. SARO 06:00 observer series suspended after the Caliche missing-person report.","Dispatch owns the search for Mara Ortiz. Reyes is to remain at an established contact point. This order is local to SARO; network action requires later independent evidence.","Physical automatic-schedule isolation has its own check and must not be inferred from this order."],"production_nb":"Bare faktisk Ward-ordre/readback. Ingen nettverkskvittering eller fysisk bryterstatus fra tekst alene."},{"id":"HR_LOCAL_ISOLATION_NOTE","title":"Local automatic schedule: isolated","kind":"typed","stamp":"SARO / NIGHT SHIFT / 13-14 APR 1986","body":["The physical auto/survey schedule has been placed in its marked isolated state and checked locally. Passive reception remains available.","Secured for the missing-person report: the receiver log and strip chart covering 21:00, the dated shift journal and the T01 service card. T01 is filed with them, once. A separately authorised bounded array check remains possible; unattended operation stays suspended."],"production_nb":"Ekte betjening/kontroll og papirhenting. T01-arkiveringen skjer her \u00e9n gang (EveningShifts eksisterende filing). Ingen avbryting av all str\u00f8m eller K3 som global bryter."},{"id":"HR_EARL_SOURCE_CHECK","title":"1420 AM: identified original-source check","kind":"typed","stamp":"SARO / NIGHT SHIFT / 13-14 APR 1986","body":["Identified 1981 off-air reel and separately preserved local log examined at 1420 AM. Source switch checked in isolated TAPE and LIVE MONITOR paths; the unused input was disconnected in each test.","The reel repeated the same fragment after a new question. The result establishes this playback's dated source and fixed content. It does not measure a bearing or identify the original sound.","1420 AM is distinct from the SARO receiver at 1420.405 MHz. Field geometry needs operator positions and fixed landmarks."],"production_nb":"Originalkontroll f\u00f8r Earl g\u00e5r04:00. M\u00e5linger stammer fra fysisk isolert opplegg; ingen Earl-forklaring etter avgang."},{"id":"HR_EARL_SOURCE_COPY","title":"1420 AM: checked dated source copy","kind":"typed","stamp":"SARO / NIGHT SHIFT / 13-14 APR 1986","body":["Earl's labelled collection envelope contains a copy identified to the 1981 off-air reel, its dated local log and a playback/disconnecti)S47HR")
TEXT(R"S47HR(on sheet.","After Earl left, Reyes used the isolated lobby deck and checked the copy's fixed fragment against a new question. This is a verified copy-source path, not an examination of the original reel.","No bearing or present location follows from the audio. Earl did not answer after his departure."],"production_nb":"Sen legitim kopi krever utleveringsrekvisitt/merking/deck/kildekontroll i runtime. Ingen gratis positivt faktum ved sen klokke."},{"id":"HR_ARRAY_CONTROL_NOTE","title":"Array service comparison","kind":"typed","stamp":"SARO / NIGHT SHIFT / 13-14 APR 1986","body":["Separate command and drive record checked for the identified Row One near group. Fixed reference lamp left at REF / R1 at unchanged setting. The ordinary service card is EV_DALE_ARRAY_SERVICE; T02's culvert index remains separate.","Operator chose A / ROW 1 WEST or B / ROW 1 EAST first, moved to the other and briefly returned. Observed dish angles changed with those physical positions against fixed landmarks; the lamp stayed at REF / R1.","The selected route, local timings and actual observations belong in the field record. Audio supports sequence and timing, not bearing. This check does not establish identity, C or Nora's motive."],"production_nb":"Servicekort/fysiske st\u00e5steder eies av EveningShift/arrayadapter. Dynamiske navn/rute-/vinkeldata m\u00e5 fylles fra faktisk feltresultat."},{"id":"HR_ROUTE_READBACK","title":"Old Roswell road: route and courier readback","kind":"typed","stamp":"SARO / NIGHT SHIFT / 13-14 APR 1986","body":["Caliche deputy's dated patrol sheet: north road and old Roswell road driven at 03:30, no obstruction recorded. Ward entered its time in her log. One drive is not proof of future safe passage.","After mapping C at bolt 8.15, Reyes agreed a courier handover at bolt 10.4 beyond it. Plan: carry the originals, pass C without stopping or taking another reading.","The warning, three source IDs and the first boundary time are already read back outside